ps://doi.org/10.1021/acs.inorgchem.2c02746.s001", "relation": {"is-component-of": [{"id-type": "doi", "id": "10.1021/acs.inorgchem.2c02746", "asserted-by": "object"}]}}, {"institution": [{"name": "Research Square"}], "indexed": {"date-parts": [[2026, 1, 30]], "date-time": "2026-01-30T05:26:09Z", "timestamp": 1769750769754, "version": "3.49.0"}, "posted": {"date-parts": [[2024, 3, 27]]}, "group-title": "In Review", "reference-count": 0, "publisher": "Research Square Platform LLC", "license": [{"start": {"date-parts": [[2024, 3, 27]], "date-time": "2024-03-27T00:00:00Z", "timestamp": 1711497600000}, "content-version": "unspecified", "delay-in-days": 0, "URL": "https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by/4.0/"}], "content-domain": {"domain": [], "crossmark-restriction": false}, "accepted": {"date-parts": [[2024, 3, 23]]}, "abstract": "<title>Abstract</title>\n        <p>Overfitting, a common issue in polynomial regression, occurs when the model fits noise rather than underlying patterns in the data. To mitigate overfitting and improve generalization, we propose a dynamic approach to select the regularization parameter lambda using k-fold cross-validation. This method ensures that the regularization strength adapts to the characteristics of the data, preventing overfitting while allowing the model to capture underlying patterns effectively. We demonstrate the effectiveness of our approach through experiments on linear and nonlinear datasets, showing improved generalization performance compared to fixed regularization parameter settings.</p>", "DOI": "10.21203/rs.3.rs-4155159/v1", "type": "posted-content", "created": {"date-parts": [[2024, 3, 27]], "date-time": "2024-03-27T04:39:50Z", "timestamp": 1711514390000}, "source": "Crossref", "is-referenced-by-count": 1, "title": ["Enhancing Generalization in Polynomial Regression Models through Dynamic Regularization Parameter Optimization"], "prefix": "10.21203", "author": [{"given": "Mourad", "family": "Henchiri", "sequence": "first", "affiliation": [{"name": "University of Nizwa"}], "role": [{"role": "author", "vocabulary": "crossref"}]}, {"given": "Sharyar", "family": "Wani", "sequence": "additional", "affiliation": [{"name": "International Islamic University Malaysia"}], "role": [{"role": "author", "vocabulary": "crossref"}]}], "member": "8761", "link": [{"URL": "https://www.researchsquare.com/article/rs-4155159/v1", "content-type": "text/html", "content-version": "vor", "intended-application": "text-mining"}, {"URL": "https://www.researchsquare.com/article/rs-4155159/v1.html", "content-type": "unspecified", "content-version": "vor", "intended-application": "similarity-checking"}], "deposited": {"date-parts": [[2024, 4, 1]], "date-time": "2024-04-01T10:14:45Z", "timestamp": 1711966485000}, "score": 23.744013, "resource": {"primary": {"URL": "https://www.researchsquare.com/article/rs-4155159/v1"}}, "issued": {"date-parts": [[2024, 3, 27]]}, "references-count": 0, "URL": "https://doi.org/10.21203/rs.3.rs-4155159/v1", "published": {"date-parts": [[2024, 3, 27]]}, "subtype": "preprint"}, {"indexed": {"date-parts": [[2026, 2, 26]], "date-time": "2026-02-26T17:16:47Z", "timestamp": 1772126207032, "version": "3.50.1"}, "description": "Supplemental Information for 10.1021/acs.chemmater.3c01456", "reference-count": 0, "publisher": "American Chemical Society (ACS)", "content-domain": {"domain": [], "crossmark-restriction": false}, "DOI": "10.1021/acs.chemmater.3c01456.s001", "type": "component", "created": {"date-parts": [[2023, 10, 27]], "date-time": "2023-10-27T10:10:28Z", "timestamp": 1698401428000}, "source": "Crossref", "is-referenced-by-count": 0, "title": ["Tuning and Enhancing Nonlinear Optical Behavior in Hybrid Arylammonium Perrhenate Salts through Halogen Substitution"], "prefix": "10.1021", "member": "316", "deposited": {"date-parts": [[2023, 11, 14]], "date-time": "2023-11-14T05:01:55Z", "timestamp": 1699938115000}, "score": 23.734898, "resource": {"primary": {"URL": "https://pubs.acs.org/doi/suppl/10.1021/acs.chemmater.3c01456/suppl_file/cm3c01456_si_001.pdf"}}, "issued": {"date-parts": [[null]]}, "references-count": 0, "URL": "https://doi.org/10.1021/acs.chemmater.3c01456.s001", "relation": {"is-component-of": [{"id-type": "doi", "id": "10.1021/acs.chemmater.3c01456", "asserted-by": "object"}]}}], "items-per-page": 10, "query": {"start-index": 0, "search-terms": null}}}